<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vishal's AWS Website</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #232F3E, #FF9900);
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        h1 {
            color: #232F3E;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Hello, I'm Vishal 👋</h1>
        <p>This website is successfully hosted on AWS Cloud ☁️</p>

        <div class="footer">
            My first step into Cloud & DevOps 🚀
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
